        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "王通字公達，琅邪臨沂人也。",
        "reading": "公達為王通字，郡望琅邪臨沂。",
        "note": "公達為王通字，郡望琅邪臨沂。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 13,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence1-13",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "祖份，梁左光祿大夫。",
        "reading": "份為通祖，官梁左光祿大夫。",
        "note": "份為通祖，官梁左光祿大夫。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 13,
        "end_codepoint": 23,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence1-23",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "父琳，司徒左長史。",
        "reading": "父琳官司徒左長史。此琳為王份子；同卷王沖、王勱傳之將王琳另人。",
        "note": "父琳官司徒左長史。此琳為王份子；同卷王沖、王勱傳之將王琳另人。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 23,
        "end_codepoint": 32,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence1-32",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "琳，齊代娶梁武帝妹義興長公主，有子九人，嵭知名。",
        "reading": "琳在齊代娶後來梁武帝之妹；通於次段以帝甥受封。九子為琳家所出，本句未逐一指所生母。",
        "note": "琳在齊代娶後來梁武帝之妹；通於次段以帝甥受封。九子為琳家所出，本句未逐一指所生母。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p001",
        "start_codepoint": 32,
        "end_codepoint": 56,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence2-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "通，梁世起家國子生，舉明經，為祕書郎、太子舍人。",
        "reading": "梁起家國子生，舉明經後任祕書郎、太子舍人。",
        "note": "梁起家國子生，舉明經後任祕書郎、太子舍人。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 24,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence2-24",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "以帝甥封武陽亭侯。",
        "reading": "以梁武帝甥封武陽亭侯。",
        "note": "以梁武帝甥封武陽亭侯。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 24,
        "end_codepoint": 33,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence2-33",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "累遷王府主簿、限外記室參軍、司徒主簿、太子中庶子、驃騎廬陵王府給事中郎、中權何敬容府長史、給事黃門侍郎，坐事免。",
        "reading": "王府諸職與宮官依次分列；何敬容為中權府主。坐事免，失官所坐未詳。",
        "note": "王府諸職與宮官依次分列；何敬容為中權府主。坐事免，失官所坐未詳。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p002",
        "start_codepoint": 33,
        "end_codepoint": 89,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence3-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "侯景之亂，奔于江陵，元帝以為散騎常侍，遷守太常卿。",
        "reading": "侯景亂時奔江陵，元帝任散騎常侍，再令守太常卿。",
        "note": "侯景亂時奔江陵，元帝任散騎常侍，再令守太常卿。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 25,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence3-25",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "自侯景亂後，臺內宮室，嵭皆焚燼，以通兼起部尚書，歸于京師，專掌繕造。",
        "reading": "建康臺內宮室遭火，通兼起部尚書返京師掌繕造；「嵭」原字照存。",
        "note": "建康臺內宮室遭火，通兼起部尚書返京師掌繕造；「嵭」原字照存。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 25,
        "end_codepoint": 59,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence4-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "江陵陷，敬帝承制以通為吏部尚書。",
        "reading": "江陵失陷，梁敬帝承制任通吏部尚書。",
        "note": "江陵失陷，梁敬帝承制任通吏部尚書。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 16,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence4-16",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "紹泰元年，加侍中，尚書如故。",
        "reading": "紹泰元年加侍中，仍任尚書。",
        "note": "紹泰元年加侍中，仍任尚書。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 16,
        "end_codepoint": 30,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence4-30",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "尋為尚書右僕射，吏部如故。",
        "reading": "遷尚書右僕射，仍掌吏部。",
        "note": "遷尚書右僕射，仍掌吏部。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 30,
        "end_codepoint": 43,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence4-43",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "高祖受禪，遷左僕射，侍中如故。",
        "reading": "陳武帝霸先受禪後遷左僕射，仍侍中。",
        "note": "陳武帝霸先受禪後遷左僕射，仍侍中。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 43,
        "end_codepoint": 58,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence4-58",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "文帝嗣位，領太子少傅。",
        "reading": "陳文帝蒨嗣位，通領太子少傅。",
        "note": "陳文帝蒨嗣位，通領太子少傅。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 58,
        "end_codepoint": 69,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence4-69",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "天康元年，為翊右將軍、右光祿大夫，量置佐史。",
        "reading": "陳天康元年為翊右將軍、右光祿大夫，量置佐史。",
        "note": "陳天康元年為翊右將軍、右光祿大夫，量置佐史。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 69,
        "end_codepoint": 91,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence4-91",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "廢帝即位，號安右將軍，又領南徐州大中正。",
        "reading": "陳廢帝伯宗即位後，改號安右將軍，並領南徐州大中正。",
        "note": "陳廢帝伯宗即位後，改號安右將軍，並領南徐州大中正。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 91,
        "end_codepoint": 111,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence4-111",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "太建元年，遷左光祿大夫。",
        "reading": "太建元年遷左光祿大夫。",
        "note": "太建元年遷左光祿大夫。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 111,
        "end_codepoint": 123,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence4-123",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "六年，加特進，侍中、將軍、光祿、佐史嵭如故。",
        "reading": "六年加特進，仍帶侍中、將軍、光祿及佐史。《宣帝紀》繫十二月景午。",
        "note": "六年加特進，仍帶侍中、將軍、光祿及佐史。《宣帝紀》繫十二月景午。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 123,
        "end_codepoint": 145,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:received_sentence4-145",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC",
        "source_quote": "未拜卒，時年七十二。",
        "reading": "新加特進未拜而卒，傳記七十二歲，未明載卒日。",
        "note": "新加特進未拜而卒，傳記七十二歲，未明載卒日。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-chenshu-017-wangtong-complete:p004",
